.TH SPPDOCS-AI-INDEX 1 "September 2026" "SPP Framework" "SPPDocs CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
sppdocs:ai:index \- Index documentation into semantic chunk vector signatures for AI search and RAG
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B php spp.php sppdocs:ai:index
[\fB\-\-project=\fIproject-id\fR]
[\fB\-\-provider=\fIoffline|openai|gemini|anthropic|ollama|custom\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBsppdocs:ai:index\fR parses all markdown documentation files for a project, chunks them into semantic sections by header, and generates vector signatures using BM25 and TF-IDF weighting. The resulting index powers natural-language question answering with exact source citations via the web search palette or REST API.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-project=\fIproject-id\fR
Target documentation project identifier (defaults to \fIdemo-app\fR).
.TP
\fB\-\-provider=\fIoffline|openai|gemini|anthropic|ollama|custom\fR
AI indexing provider (defaults to \fIoffline\fR).
.SH UNDER THE HOOD
Decomposes markdown files in the project's pages directory into heading-bounded chunks, calculates term frequencies, builds \fIdocs/<project-id>/vector-index.json\fR, and strictly restricts execution to the CLI SAPI.
